==English==

===Etymology===
{{back-form|manipulation|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/məˈnɪpjʊleɪt/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-manipulate.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|manipulat}}

# {{label|en|transitive}} To [[move]], [[arrange]] or [[operate]] something using the [[hand]]s
# {{label|en|transitive}} To [[influence]], [[manage]], [[direct]], [[control]] or [[tamper]] with something
# {{label|en|transitive|medicine}} To [[handle]] and move a [[body]] part, either as an [[examination]] or for a [[therapeutic]] purpose

====Related terms====
* [[manipulandum]] {{pos n}}
* [[manipulation]] {{pos n}}

